			"Message": "build(Mountain): enhance binary build configurability\n\n- Remove deprecated Queue submodule and unused dependencies to streamline project structure\n- Migrate Cargo.toml dependencies to workspace-level management for consistent versioning\n- Implement new binary module with dynamic build configuration capabilities:\n  - Temporarily modifies Cargo.toml package name and Tauri config during builds\n  - Generates environment-specific bundle identifiers (e.g., 'land.editor.binary.mountain...')\n  - Adds Windows subsystem configuration for silent background operation\n  - Implements atomic file modifications with automatic backup/restore functionality\n- Integrates with Mountain's Tauri backend requirements for:\n  - Custom binary naming based on build parameters (Browser/Bundle/Clean flags)\n  - Version synchronization between Cargo.toml and Tauri configuration\n  - Proper environment isolation for different build targets (production/development)\n\nRefs #123",
			"SHA": "15a55765c37faebb9284acfb3a9b30644d304f05"
